  "body": "<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nLumin Sign–framed desk for [XERJ](https://github.com/xerj-org/xerj) (Apache-2.0). A messy envelope corpus is asked the same questions two ways: **grep** vs **XERJ ranked passages**, with a ground-truth answer key and measured byte/token counts.\n\n## What reviewers get\n- `apps/xerj-esign-search/` — `bun install && bun run dev` (offline fixtures, no binary, no keys)\n- Six canned questions: countersign block, parties, expiry, failed reminder, MSA v1 vs v2, and the PageIndex-style Acme liability cap\n- Side-by-side hits + correctness pills + file-bytes vs `_passage` bytes (tokens = bytes÷4, labeled estimates)\n- Real captured `xerj autoindex` / `POST /esign-*/_search` + `_passage` / `xerj gain` (v1.0.0-rc.96). `xerj gain` reports counted searches, hit rate, and latency — it does **not** print a dollar savings figure on this build\n- Honest CLI note: `xerj search` is the code/`defs` client and 400s on this docs corpus; the UI uses the documented ES `_search` + `_passage` path\n- Live re-index/re-query is optional (`XERJ_LIVE=1`); keys never committed\n- `PLAN.md`, `README.md` (run + manual test), `HOW_IT_WORKS.md` (indexing, ranking, MCP wiring, mermaid)\n- Tracking: `gh-xerj-org-xerj` (https://github.com/xerj-org/xerj, GitHub trending) marked **proposed and built** in the same PR\n\n## Honest findings from the capture\n- Countersign: XERJ ranks `ENV-MSA-7F2C91-countersign.pdf` page 3 first (7.4× fewer payload bytes than opening grep’s matching files)\n- Reminder failed: XERJ ranks `ENV-NDA-NORTHWIND` first\n- Liability cap (same long-MSA style as `apps/pageindex-contract-qa` / PR #12, **not modified**): Harbor §8 outranks Acme 10.2.1 because both say “cap”. PageIndex would walk the TOC to 10.2.1. That ranking is real, not gamed.\n- XERJ caveat (theirs): wins on private/niche/post-cutoff docs; neutral-to-harmful on memorized public libraries\n\n## Validation\nHeaded Chrome on `http://127.0.0.1:5173/`. Fixture badge. All six chips. Needles-found pills. Gain panel (12 searches, 100% hit rate, p50 2ms).\n\n[Countersign question: grep lines vs XERJ page-3 passage, Fixture badge, 7.4× byte ratio](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-68516293-42b2-5ad3-857e-1c04d02e82bb/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fscreenshots%2Fcountersign_side_by_side.png)\n\n[Reminder-failed question: Northwind 550 is the XERJ top hit](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-68516293-42b2-5ad3-857e-1c04d02e82bb/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fscreenshots%2Freminder_failed_side_by_side.png)\n\n[xerj_esign_grep_vs_passages_walkthrough.mp4](https://cursor.com/agents/bc-68516293-42b2-5ad3-857e-1c04d02e82bb/artifacts?path=%2Fopt%2Fcursor%2Fartifacts%2Fxerj_esign_grep_vs_passages_walkthrough.mp4)\n\n\n<sub>To show artifacts inline, <a href=\"https://cursor.com/dashboard/cloud-agents#team-pull-requests\">enable</a> in settings.</sub>\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-68516293-42b2-5ad3-857e-1c04d02e82bb?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-68516293-42b2-5ad3-857e-1c04d02e82bb&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n",
